Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=19}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:54.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So you're a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:55.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:57.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that why you went and\Ndid a crazy thing like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.81,0:02:00.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,shoot a cannonball into the restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:01.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.27,0:02:04.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A stray shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.69,0:02:09.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In any case, you really don't want\Nto do anything stupid to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The owner used to be a cook\Nin a famous pirate fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.07,0:02:17.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ohh... So the old man...\Nused to be a pirate...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:19.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This restaurant is everything\Nto that crazy old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.66,0:02:22.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the only treasure he'll\Nneed for the rest of his life...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.54,0:02:23.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'll do anything to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:27.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}On top of which, all of the cooks\Nwho joined him out of respect and admiration
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.59,0:02:30.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,are just as hot-headed as any pirate...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:33.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which helps since pirates are always\Ncoming and going out of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:35.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've noticed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.43,0:02:39.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a really wild\Nrestaurant, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.01,0:02:41.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So true... And this is\Nhow it is every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.81,0:02:45.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's gotten so bad that customers\Nare coming here just watch fights
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.19,0:02:47.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,between the cooks and the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.23,0:02:50.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Every day, it's been a new\Npirate ship and a new rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.27,0:02:52.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It wasn't long till all the\Nwaiters got scared and bailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, that makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.11,0:02:57.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that's why the old man wanted\Nme to work for him for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.99,0:03:00.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, you joining my pirate crew or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:01.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:04.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a reason I have to\Nwork here in the restaurant,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:05.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and so I can't just walk away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:06.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.96,0:03:07.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} don't accept!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:09.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What? You don't accept?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:10.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.71,0:03:12.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept your refusal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.59,0:03:13.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a good cook, and I need one,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.76,0:03:16.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so it's obvious that we\Nshould be pirates together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.26,0:03:17.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen to what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:19.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't leave here, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's your reason for staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:22.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have to tell you anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:23.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:25.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you just said to listen to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:28.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I told you my answer was no,\Nand that's all you need to hear from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:31.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now take your pirate ship, and\Nfind a cook someplace else
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:32.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,before I cut you up, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:34.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You listen to me, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.49,0:03:38.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one makes fun of my straw hat\Nunless they're ready for a beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to interrupt...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:41.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:45.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My name is Ghin, and I'm a crew\Nmember of Don Krieg's Pirate fleet...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:47.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you say that you're\Na pirate yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:49.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it you seek?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:50.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, the One Piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.21,0:03:53.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And pretty soon, I'm gonna sail\Nthe Grand Line and find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:54.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:03:59.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, you can't have been\Nseeking it for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.59,0:04:03.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you don't even have a cook yet,\Nyour crew can't be all that big.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:04.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope, he's only the fifth member.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:06.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm not going,\Nso don't count me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.85,0:04:10.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You seem like a nice kid, so let me\Ngive you some friendly advice, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:13.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line is a\Nplace you want to avoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:16.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're still young, there's\Nno need to rush into anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:19.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Remember, the Grand Line is one\Nsmall part of this entire ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:21.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you want to be a real\Npirate, there are plenty of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.91,0:04:25.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,other places out here\Non the seas to explore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.12,0:04:26.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm... I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.95,0:04:29.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, why don't you just tell me\Nwhat to avoid in the Grand Line now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:32.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:34.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:37.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that is why I fear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:41.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}For being a crewmember of\NDon Krieg's, you're a pretty wimpy pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.68,0:04:43.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hm? Who's Don Krieg?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:55.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The appetizer\Nfor table three is ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:04:57.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah, well you're gonna\Nhave to take it out yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.65,0:04:59.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the last waiter's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.45,0:05:01.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You think more of them\Nwill be comin', Patty?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.36,0:05:03.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:06.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I heard the guy you beat up earlier in\Nthe restaurant was one of Don Krieg's men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:09.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't think that will make\Nthe rest of them very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:12.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh... I don't care whose man he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:15.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All I'm saying is, the stories\NI've heard say Don Krieg is
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:18.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the strongest, fiercest and most evil\Npirate in this part of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.46,0:05:19.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:20.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:26.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,On these waters, his grip\Nof fear reaches far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:33.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2\fad(0,2026)}He commands over fifty pirate captains,\None of the largest pirate fleets ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:36.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He is truly... a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:38.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He doesn't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:41.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've heard that his extraordinary fleet
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:44.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of ships has more than\Nfive thousand pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:48.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This could be bad for Boss Zeff...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:51.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If that guy you beat up\Ngoes to Don Krieg and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:53.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,tells him what you did,\Nand he sends just one ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:56.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There won't be enough\Nof us to fight them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:58.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll be crushed, like\Na grape under an elephant,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.71,0:06:00.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and left to sink to the\Nbottom of the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:03.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.05,0:06:05.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You're saying I should have just served\Nhim, so he could experience our
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:08.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,great customer service\Nand meals for free?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:12.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You don't think that would have been rude\Nto the other damn crooks who pay money?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:15.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I would never stoop that low!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:17.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the Baratie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:20.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The fighting cooks have a\Nreputation to uphold, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:24.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd never ruin that. I don't\Ncare who that pirate cries to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:27.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let them send their ships.\NI'll fight them all off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.03,0:06:29.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're scared, quit and\Nlet the real cooks work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:30.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare say that to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:32.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of all that\Nbig talk you spit out,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:35.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,which is why all the\Nwaiters jumped ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:37.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everything that's happening\Nnow is all your fault, Patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:38.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:43.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Those waiters were worthless wimps the moment\Na customer showed up! Worthless wimps!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.72,0:06:45.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.51,0:06:46.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take him out, Carne!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.84,0:06:49.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}He doesn't stand a chance, Patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:51.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, what's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:52.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get back to work already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:55.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, Boss Zeff!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:57.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So long, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.86,0:06:59.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the warning,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.02,0:07:00.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I'm still gonna\Ngo to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.86,0:07:01.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:03.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:07.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I'm just a stranger, and I can't stop you\Nfrom going anywhere you wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:10.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to give\Nyou a fair warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.33,0:07:14.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And to you, Chef...\NThank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:16.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You saved my life,\Nand I owe you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:19.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your cooking skills are\Nthe best I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:21.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope to come back again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.88,0:07:23.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll have a seat for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:25.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chore Boy, get up here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:27.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Boss Zeff!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.51,0:07:29.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:36.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ghin... Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:37.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:41.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You'll probably get yelled at or fired\N'cause you gave me that food for free...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:44.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.15,0:07:48.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.41,0:07:56.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now there's not proof, so there's\Nno way for me to get yelled at.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.13,0:08:02.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Try not to get\Ncaught again, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:04.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you again, Chef Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:06.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will never forget your kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:10.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Chore Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:12.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get back to work already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.89,0:08:15.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, table three is ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:20.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:23.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My name's Luffy, and I'm gonna\Nbe the new chore boy around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.23,0:08:24.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.17,0:08:40.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened to that dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:45.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which one of us was\Nsupposed to make that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:46.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was supposed to be him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.80,0:08:49.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to\Nmake that, I'm too busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.18,0:08:50.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're too busy being a jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:52.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Say that again, I dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:56.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't just sit\Nthere picking your nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.72,0:08:59.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go wash the dishes or\Nsomething... Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:01.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:03.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think I saw\Nhim hittin' on a customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:04.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.90,0:09:06.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wish Boss Zeff would get rid of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:10.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It's bad enough he's the Sous Chef,\Nbut he's never in the kitchen doing his job!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:12.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think we're stuck with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.41,0:09:14.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's worked here longer than any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:17.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He was working the kitchen and\Nthe dining room even before I started.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.75,0:09:19.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but even so,\NI just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:21.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why does he stay here when
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:23.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he and Boss Zeff are always fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.46,0:09:25.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think he wants\Nto be the Head Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.67,0:09:30.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:28.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.93,0:09:31.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chore Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:35.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Just how many of these dishes have\Nyou gone and broken into tiny pieces?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:36.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.72,0:09:38.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I forgot to count! Aw, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:40.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I wasn't being serious, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:41.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you breaking them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.98,0:09:45.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop screwing around,\Nand clean up your mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.11,0:09:47.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That, I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:47.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.73,0:09:50.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't take the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:51.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:53.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was a perfect entree!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.74,0:09:55.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep! Pretty tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.95,0:10:00.50,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.50,0:10:03.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Get out of our kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:06.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't we have you take\Norders in the dining room?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.46,0:10:08.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just ask the customers\Nwhat they want to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:10.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that simple enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.59,0:10:13.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,These chores sure are boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:16.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wonder if Koby got tired\Nof all this work, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.60,0:10:17.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chore Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:19.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.39,0:10:21.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We heard you had to work\Nhere for a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.81,0:10:24.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it okay if we redraw\Nthe flag for our ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.23,0:10:27.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're eating all\Nthis delicious food without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:28.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kind of crew are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:30.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could you do this to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:33.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on... I think that's our\Nbusiness, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:34.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:37.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy... This is gonna be so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:41.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, I have to say the food\Nhere is really quite delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:44.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.67,0:10:47.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.67,0:10:49.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should be drinking this yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.72,0:10:55.05,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:58.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I can't\Nbelieve {\i1}you{\i0} did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:11:00.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Aw, that was nasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.81,0:11:08.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Aren't they... quaint...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:10.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if that's\Nthe rest of his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.91,0:11:18.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Finish pouring it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:23.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Oh, dear ocean, thank you for this\Ntreasure you have shared from your depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.16,0:11:24.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:25.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, my love...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:28.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't bear this hardship\Nof loving you from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:29.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is too difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:33.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am now prepared to sail to the\Nends of the earth as a pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:36.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if it means someone of your\Nrare beauty will be by my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:41.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To be together sailing the seas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:44.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But how tragic a great\Nobstacle blocks our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:47.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that great\Nobstacle would be me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.69,0:11:48.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:50.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid geezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:52.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is an opportunity you\Ndon't want to pass up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:54.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why not join them and become a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:58.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have no need to keep\Nyou here at my restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:16.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:21.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This cook saved your life, and you\Nwere able to return here to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:26.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\c&H090704&\3c&H090704&\4c&H090704&\t(-779,722,1,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\4c&H000000&)}Is that what you are saying... Ghin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:29.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Y... Yes... but you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.35,0:12:33.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I had no idea the main ship was\Nin this condition, Don Krieg...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:34.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.65,0:12:38.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.61,0:12:42.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, I believe I'll take you\Nto the Sea Restaurant Baratie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.75,0:12:50.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen, pal...\NI'm the Sous Chef in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.67,0:12:53.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you\Ndon't need me any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.63,0:12:55.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fight with customers\Nall the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:58.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You flirt with every woman under\Neighty who walks through here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.88,0:13:01.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can't even cook a decent meal...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:04.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're worth less to me than\Nthe chum after brunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:05.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So... uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:14.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Oh, and let's not forget about how\Nthe other cooks avoid you like you were poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:20.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So just run off and be a pirate or whatever,\Nbut get out of this restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.03,0:13:23.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's how it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:27.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You shoot off at the mouth and expect\Nthat I'm just going to take it, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:34.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I could blow off everything you said,\Nbut I won't listen to anyone trash my cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:37.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm staying here as a\NSous Chef, and that's final!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:39.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.63,0:13:42.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing,\Ngrabbing your boss by the collar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.39,0:13:46.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You ingrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:54.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can try to kick me out...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:58.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I'm here to stay. I'm not\Ngoing anywhere, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:14:00.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not till you're dead and gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:01.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dead? Hah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.36,0:14:04.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I got another hundred years\Nof kickin' your ass left in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.53,0:14:06.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's always\Ngotta have the last word.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:08.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See? He said it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.24,0:14:09.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now you can become a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:10.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:12.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My apologies...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:17.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I hope I can make it up to you with this\Ndelightful fruit Macedonia, my princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.46,0:14:20.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow! You're too kind!\NIt looks wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:21.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:23.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't forget about\Nus, Mister Casanova!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:26.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'd better get some\Nkind of an apology, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.22,0:14:28.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This tea should be more\Nthan adequate for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.93,0:14:30.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In fact, you should be thanking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.77,0:14:32.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! You wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.23,0:14:34.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're gonna regret this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:35.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take him out, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:37.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:39.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Please don't\Nfight because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.69,0:14:40.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course, my dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.69,0:14:42.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who said it was about you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:44.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanted to tell you that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.03,0:14:44.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:47.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That all of the food\Nhere is just delicious...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:49.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it's a little too expensive for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:50.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Relax, it's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.74,0:14:52.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:54.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys still gotta pay, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:55.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:56.88,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,How very generous of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:02.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}What are you sitting around for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:04.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're not here to lounge around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:05.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:39.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's them... They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:41.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The hourglasses mean our time is up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:44.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.30,0:15:46.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That flag means death!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:52.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt; it belongs to the\Nruler of the East Blue... Don Krieg!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:10.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But why? Why have\Nthe Krieg Pirates come here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:13.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I told you! I knew those\Ngoons would show up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:15.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now are you gonna get rid\Nof those guys or what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.29,0:16:17.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This can't be real! He's got\Na whole fleet to command.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:21.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would Don Krieg come here to\Nget revenge for just one man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:23.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I mean, doesn't he have\Nanything better to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:26.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's here, all right! We're not\Nimagining that ship, are we?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.67,0:16:30.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys, don't panic, but I think this\Nis our cue to leave, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:32.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look at the sheer size of that galleon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:41.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a huge ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.86,0:16:44.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You think Ghin came back to\Nrepay you for your kindness?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.94,0:16:47.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I seriously doubt that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.28,0:16:49.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– It's something else.\N– Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:16:58.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.91,0:17:01.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Their ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:09.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what'd they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:11.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sail through a hurricane or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:17:14.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem like damage\Ninflicted by cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.89,0:17:17.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In fact, it doesn't\Nlook man-made at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.89,0:17:22.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hmm, then maybe\Nit was a tornado-hurricane!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.35,0:17:24.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.46,0:17:47.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I beg you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.46,0:17:53.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need food... and water...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.47,0:17:55.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have money...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.43,0:17:57.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lots of money...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.18,0:18:00.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, this can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.85,0:18:02.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where's the death and destruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.98,0:18:07.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is this really the Don Krieg,\NCommodore of the grand pirate fleet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.28,0:18:10.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess he's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.16,0:18:17.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C... Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.95,0:18:21.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.96,0:18:25.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, help him! Our captain\Nis on the brink of starvation!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:27.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He could die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.96,0:18:30.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He hasn't had a single\Nbite to eat for days!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.34,0:18:32.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'll die if he doesn't\Nget some food soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.43,0:18:41.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:43.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't laughed that\Nhard in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.85,0:18:46.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The great Don Krieg,\Nkneeling before us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.61,0:18:48.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have some money!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.15,0:18:49.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're here as customers this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.86,0:18:51.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'm that stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.99,0:18:54.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Get a hold of\Nthe marines right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.36,0:18:55.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:57.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's finally weak\Nenough to be captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.20,0:18:59.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This may never happen again,\Nand I'm not gonna ruin it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:01.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,by helping him get his strength back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:03.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.71,0:19:05.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who knows what he'll do if\Ngets on his feet again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.71,0:19:07.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's done terrible things!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:10.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And as soon as he's\Nup, he'll keep on doin' 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:12.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I say we let him starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:16.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once he's back to normal, he'll kill\Nevery last person in this restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.47,0:19:20.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He won't get so much as\Na glass of water from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.68,0:19:22.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't do anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.31,0:19:27.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't do anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.85,0:19:29.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once I eat...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.65,0:19:32.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll leave quietly...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:35.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So please... Be merciful, and help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:38.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a king, Don Krieg, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.16,0:19:40.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, don't reduce yourself to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.53,0:19:42.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're better than the common beggar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.87,0:19:45.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, sir! What about your pride?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:47.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I promise...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:50.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please... I'll take the scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.75,0:19:53.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll take anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.09,0:19:55.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:19:58.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:05.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heh, boo-hoo for the cruel pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:07.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, step aside, Patty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.35,0:20:10.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.19,0:20:15.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:18.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:19.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.62,0:20:23.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Here's something for your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.12,0:20:28.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.21,0:20:35.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.52,0:20:47.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You dimwit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.35,0:20:49.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get that food away from him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.35,0:20:52.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize he's a cold,\Nheartless, killing machine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.73,0:20:55.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the man known as\Nthe ruler of the East Blue,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.53,0:20:57.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the most treacherous of all pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.03,0:21:01.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It all started back in prison...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:03.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He pretended to be a Marine...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.41,0:21:06.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And when he decided to\Ndeclare his pirate ambitions,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.24,0:21:10.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he took command of a Marine vessel\Nby killing the senior officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.46,0:21:14.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He would raise the\NMarine flag to enter ports,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:18.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,then lay waste to the unsuspecting\Ncities and passenger ships there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:21.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He even showed the white flag\Nbefore attacking enemy ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:24.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He did anything to secure victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.01,0:21:27.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That guy fights dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:30.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's also unmatched\Nin physical combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.81,0:21:32.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You think he'll just leave us alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.94,0:21:35.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got news for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.15,0:21:38.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not possible with a\Nbloodthirsty killer like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.99,0:21:40.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He deserves death!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.46,0:22:00.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.10,0:22:10.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is not what we agreed on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.39,0:22:13.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You gave me your word! I only\Nbrought you here because
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.14,0:22:16.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you promised that you\Nwouldn't ruin this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.44,0:22:18.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Or hurt the man who saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:24.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, that was delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.24,0:22:28.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I feel alive again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:44.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey... You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.84,0:22:47.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.22,0:22:49.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think is going on in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.22,0:22:50.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't know. Let's go inside and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.77,0:22:52.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.14,0:22:56.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is a pretty good ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.56,0:22:59.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I believe that I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.65,0:23:05.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right... I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.46,0:23:17.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As you can all see, my ship is a wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.83,0:23:20.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Naturally, I'll be\Nneeding a nice new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.38,0:23:22.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After a few small chores...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.05,0:23:24.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Every last one of you\Nwill leave the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.80,0:23:26.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.22,0:23:30.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don Krieg... You promised... Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.77,0:23:38.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}There are about a hundred men left\Nonboard my ship, all are weak with hunger,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.56,0:23:40.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and many are seriously wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.65,0:23:46.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If you value your lives, you will prepare\Nfood and water for every last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.24,0:23:50.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've lost too many\Nmen to hunger already...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.74,0:23:54.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Water...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.71,0:23:58.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bring them over immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.83,0:24:01.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're telling us to\Nfeed our executioners?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.80,0:24:06.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you hear how stupid\Nthat sounds?! We refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.05,0:24:07.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.72,0:24:09.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wasn't asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.64,0:24:14.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now make no mistake, you wretched\Ncook, I'm not {\i1}placing{\i0} an order...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.35,0:24:15.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am {\i1}giving{\i0} you one!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.85,0:24:21.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear?!\NDon't defy me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.95,0:24:28.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.49,0:24:31.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji... Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.74,0:24:34.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean for this to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.33,0:24:35.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.75,0:24:38.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look what you brought on this\Nrestaurant, you stupid bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.59,0:24:52.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.52,0:24:59.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.15,0:25:03.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To the kitchen...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.02,0:25:05.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'll be cooking\Na hundred more meals today.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.90,0:25:07.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.78,0:25:08.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.53,0:25:11.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?! Are you crazy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.91,0:25:14.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good... Hop to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.62,0:25:22.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth, Sanji!\NAre you his spy or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.29,0:25:24.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't let you go\Nanywhere near that kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.84,0:25:26.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're fed up\Nwith you acting insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.59,0:25:31.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.68,0:25:33.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop me if you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.31,0:25:38.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.39,0:25:43.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's no secret that Don Krieg\Nis a terrible, ruthless man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.86,0:25:46.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.11,0:25:48.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't matter to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.36,0:25:50.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.82,0:25:56.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After we feed all these men, who\Nknows what's going to happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.33,0:25:59.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am just a simple cook,\Nno more and no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.50,0:26:02.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If someone's going hungry,\Nit's my duty to feed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.83,0:26:04.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's all I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.92,0:26:08.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whaddya say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.09,0:26:09.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.14,0:26:18.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Patty!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.22,0:26:20.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Somebody grab him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.23,0:26:26.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You bring free food to the bums I kick\Noutta this place, over and over again...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.82,0:26:30.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'm not about to argue over who's\Nright in that particular situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.65,0:26:33.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but this time, you're just\Nflat out wrong, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.78,0:26:36.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't let you do things\Nlike that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.32,0:26:38.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're going to protect this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.41,0:26:40.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, we've got\Nnumbers on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.33,0:26:45.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is Don Krieg, but what\Ncould he do against all of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.17,0:26:50.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,At a joint like this, pirate\Nscumbags come and go all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.38,0:26:53.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're fully prepared to\Nserve any kind of customer!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.68,0:26:54.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.84,0:27:00.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I really hope you saved some room for\Ndessert... 'cause I have a secret recipe...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.56,0:27:01.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.47,0:27:04.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... that is truly to die for!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.27,0:27:09.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Open wide! Here comes\Nthe Meat Ball of Doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.28,0:27:21.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.50,0:27:27.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.76,0:27:34.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I might've broken the door...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.80,0:27:37.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I sure hope Zeff doesn't\Nyell at me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.01,0:27:40.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He might go easy on you for\Nsaving the restaurant and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.47,0:27:44.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So what are we going to do about\Nall the guys left in Krieg's ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.98,0:27:49.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fry 'em! Cover it in batter,\Nand fry the entire thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.31,0:27:53.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you a chef or a comedian?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.23,0:27:55.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because your jokes are lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.53,0:27:59.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that dessert was terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.03,0:28:02.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The worst I ever had!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.29,0:28:10.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So die!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.59,0:28:17.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's got 'em everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.43,0:28:18.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All those guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.65,0:28:34.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You cooks should not have defied me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.65,0:28:40.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am by far the world's strongest man!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.16,0:28:42.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Arms, made of solid steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.37,0:28:45.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wootz steel body armor, impenetrable!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.50,0:28:50.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And a diamond fist that could\Npound this entire world to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.00,0:28:52.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In addition to the weapons on my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.21,0:28:56.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have a fleet of fifty ships\Nwith five thousand pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.05,0:28:57.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My record is perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.47,0:29:00.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've won every single battle\Nthat I've ever been in!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.84,0:29:02.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am Don!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.55,0:29:06.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'm the only one\Nfit to be called Don!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.14,0:29:07.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Outta the way, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.85,0:29:10.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wha... Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.14,0:29:15.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}When I give you slime balls an order,\Nyou will follow it down to the last letter!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.98,0:29:18.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever disobey me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.57,0:29:23.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is about a hundred meals...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.95,0:29:26.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now take it to your men right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.08,0:29:27.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, Owner Zeff!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.71,0:29:33.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're... Red Foot Zeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.01,0:29:40.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wha... What're you doing?!\NYou can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.51,0:29:42.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If all of those\Npirates get their strength back,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.59,0:29:45.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the restaurant will be\Ncompletely taken over!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.60,0:29:49.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That would be true... if they\Nstill had the will to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.69,0:29:52.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.56,0:29:54.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did your will survive defeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.90,0:29:59.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That... can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.65,0:30:02.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The great Don Krieg was defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.61,0:30:05.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa... Not even he could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.62,0:30:09.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A pirate fleet with fifty ships\Ncouldn't make it on the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.87,0:30:10.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.62,0:30:13.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is you, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.92,0:30:15.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're Red Foot Zeff!
Comment: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:04.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=20}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Comment: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:04.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=23}============================SIGNS AND TITLE=========================
